A: How do you say you'll finish something, in Russian, and not just spend time on it?
    draw o_tom o_book o_q

A: From lesson thirty-two you can say: за́втра я бу́ду чита́ть. Tomorrow I'll be reading.
    draw o_known o_known_g

B: But will you get to the end? For that, Russian says: за́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу.
    draw o_new o_new_g

A: Прочита́ю is lesson forty-four's done verb, прочита́л, with the endings of чита́ю.
    highlight o_new color #8a5fa8 part прочита́ю

    erase o_tom o_book o_q o_known o_known_g o_new o_new_g

A: To see the difference, picture tomorrow evening as a line through time.
    draw tl_axis tl_time

A: Бу́ду чита́ть is a stretch along it: the reading goes on, page after page.
    draw tl_band tl_open tl_doing

B: That's why it goes with how long: я бу́ду чита́ть весь ве́чер.
    draw tl_glass tl_whole

A: Весь is new: the whole. Весь ве́чер, the whole evening; весь день, the whole day.
    draw tl_whole_g

B: Прочита́ю is the point at the end: the last page, and the book is done.
    draw tl_dot tl_link tl_done tl_closed tl_check

    hide timeline

A: (@draw h_now h_fut@) So how do you make them? For these verbs, start from the present (@draw b1@) you know, and put the done verb's piece in front.

B: Де́лаю, сде́лаю. Пишу́, напишу́. Смотрю́, посмотрю́.
    draw b2 b3 b4

A: A done verb has no now: these present endings always point to the future.
    highlight h_fut color #8a5fa8 effect circle

A: Lesson sixty-four's (@draw b5 b_glo5@) verbs work too: при and иду́ make приду́, one и dropped, I'll (@draw b6 b_glo6@) come; е́ду, уе́ду, I'll leave.

B: And the endings run on as usual: ты прочита́ешь, мы посмо́трим.
    draw b_ends

    erase b_glo5 b_glo6 b_ends

    hide board

    draw x_bad

A: So never бу́ду with a done verb: бу́ду прочита́ть is not Russian.
    draw x_strike x_good1 x_good2

    erase x_bad x_strike x_good1 x_good2

A: Now just listen to Masha, and pick what she means.
    draw l_masha l_ear

    ask "What does Masha say?" listen "Я напишу́ письмо́." voice b gloss "I'll write the letter." options ["I was writing a letter.","I'm writing a letter.","I'll write the letter."] correct 3 reveal.text "Я напишу́ письмо́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 230 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833
        right: Напишу́: a done verb with present endings, so the letter will be written.
        wrong: Listen to the front of the verb: на. A done verb has no now.

    erase l_masha l_ear

A: This evening Masha asks Tom about his plans. Listen, then practise it.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Том, что ты бу́дешь де́лать ве́чером?","gloss":"Tom, what will you do this evening?"},{"by":"a","text":"Я приду́ домо́й в семь и бу́ду чита́ть.","gloss":"I'll get home at seven and read."},{"by":"b","text":"Весь ве́чер?","gloss":"All evening?"},{"by":"a","text":"Да! Сего́дня я прочита́ю кни́гу.","gloss":"Yes! I'll finish the book tonight."},{"by":"b","text":"А я за́втра уе́ду на мо́ре. Я тебе́ напишу́!","gloss":"And tomorrow I'm off to the sea. I'll write to you!"},{"by":"a","text":"Хорошо́! Пока́, Ма́ша!","gloss":"Great! Bye, Masha!"}] practice true size 1.5

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk_1

    draw talk

    erase talk_2

    draw talk

    erase talk_3

    draw talk

    erase talk

B: Весь ве́чер for the time, прочита́ю for the book that gets finished.
    draw pair_a pair_b

    erase pair_a pair_b

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    icon q1_t size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 480 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    icon q1_b size 110 set twemoji x 540 y 480 or ["books"] icon_look picture of "open book"
    icon q1_h size 90 set twemoji x 670 y 480 or ["hourglass done","stopwatch"] icon_look picture of "hourglass not done"

    quiz "Tom will spend the whole evening with his book: Весь ве́чер я ___ кни́гу. Which fits?" reveal.text "бу́ду чита́ть весь ве́чер" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Весь ве́чер says how long, and how long goes with бу́ду and the doing verb.
        wrong: Is it the time it fills, or a book that gets finished?
        * прочита́ю
        + бу́ду чита́ть

    erase q1_t q1_b q1_h

    icon q2_m size 150 set twemoji x 400 y 480 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon q2_l size 120 set twemoji x 600 y 480 or ["love letter","memo"] icon_look picture of envelope

    quiz "Masha promises the letter will be finished tomorrow: За́втра я ___ письмо́. Which fits?" reveal.text "За́втра я напишу́ письмо́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Напишу́: пишу́ with на in front, the done verb, so it's the future.
        wrong: Пишу́ is now, and бу́ду never goes with a done verb.
        + напишу́
        * пишу́
        * бу́ду написа́ть

    erase q2_m q2_l

    icon q3_f size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["television"] icon_look picture of "clapper board"

    quiz "Which one is NOT Russian?" reveal.text "бу́ду + done: ✗" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 220 reveal.style label reveal.size 50 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Бу́ду посмотре́ть: бу́ду never goes with a done verb. Say я посмотрю́.
        wrong: Look for бу́ду next to a verb with a piece in front.
        * Я посмотрю́ фильм.
        * Мы бу́дем смотре́ть фильм.
        + Я бу́ду посмотре́ть фильм.

    erase question_3_stamp

A: Not бу́ду посмотре́ть, but я посмотрю́ фильм.
    text q3_bad "Я бу́ду посмотре́ть фильм." colors {"^по":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 430 font_size 50
    path q3_x #b5482e points [[200,430],[800,430]] style.stroke_width 6
    text q3_good "Я посмотрю́ фильм." say "Я посмотрю́ фильм." colors {"^по":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 320 font_size 56

    erase q3_f q3_bad q3_x q3_good

    icon q4_h size 140 set twemoji x 420 y 400 or ["house with garden"] icon_look picture of house
    icon q4_c size 120 set twemoji x 590 y 400 or ["mantelpiece clock","alarm clock"] icon_look picture of "seven o’clock"

    ask "Say it like Tom: you'll get home at seven." say_it "Я приду́ домо́й в семь." gloss "I'll get home at seven." voice a show cue reveal.text "Я приду́ домо́й в семь." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 230 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q4_h q4_c

    icon q5_b size 140 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["green book","books"] icon_look picture of "closed book"

    ask "Now build the sentence. Type: Tomorrow I'll finish the book." answer ["завтра я прочитаю книгу","я прочитаю книгу завтра","завтра прочитаю книгу","я завтра прочитаю книгу"] reveal.text "За́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: За́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу: про in front, and the endings of чита́ю.
        wrong: Start from я чита́ю, put про in front for done, and no бу́ду.

    erase q5_b

    show timeline

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So for tomorrow you choose: бу́ду and a doing verb, for the hours it fills;
    highlight tl_band color #2a7f86

B: or the done verb with its present endings, for what gets finished: прочита́ю.
    highlight tl_dot tl_done color #8a5fa8 effect circle

    hide timeline

A: За́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу! Пока́!
    icon end_tom size 160 set twemoji x 380 y 470 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    icon end_book size 120 set twemoji x 580 y 470 or ["green book","books"] icon_look picture of "closed book"
    text end_say "За́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу! Пока́!" say "За́втра я прочита́ю кни́гу! Пока́!" colors {"^про":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 290 font_size 56

    erase end_tom end_book end_say

A: Next time: прочита́й! Commands, and which verb they take.
